      "message": "\u003e This test will pass with this change: https://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/third_party/zephyr/+/6107742\n\n\u003e I believe though that this has to be pushed upstream\n\nNo. Somebody could rely on that behavior. Please note that `_exit()` is weak, so you can override it e.g. https://source.chromium.org/chromiumos/chromiumos/codesearch/+/main:src/platform/ec/libc/sbrk.c\n\nYou can create `exit.c` file and implement `_exit` that does what you want.",
