      "message": "\u003e [FS] Do you mean someone can reply on this bahavior in the upstream?\n\nYes.\n\n\u003e where in our zephyr implementation can we override the exit function? Is there a specific location that you recommend?\n\nThe link above points to the file that implements our `_sbrk()` function. Just create `platform/ec/libc/exit.c` and put implementation there.",
