      "message": "I moved `_exit` function definition into a separate file.\nhttps://chromium-review.googlesource.com/c/chromiumos/platform/ec/+/6112740\n\nlibc/syscalls.c has already a definition of `_exit`. This caused nothing to the zephyr build. \n\nWhy moving the `_exit` function into a separate file will impact zephyr? Does zephyr includes their object files in its build system?",
