      "writtenOn": "2024-12-20T00:01:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e This caused nothing to the zephyr build.\n\nThe Zephyr build uses CMake, not the Makefiles. Search for [`sbrk.c` in the `platform/ec/zephyr` directory](https://source.chromium.org/search?q\u003dsbrk.c\u0026ss\u003dchromiumos%2Fchromiumos%2Fcodesearch:src%2Fplatform%2Fec%2Fzephyr%2F\u0026start\u003d1) to see where it\u0027s being configured to be built with CMake. \n\nThere is more information on the Zephyr build system [here](https://docs.zephyrproject.org/latest/build/cmake/index.html). You\u0027ll probably want to learn more about CMake. Documention [here](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/index.html) and tutorfial [here](https://cmake.org/cmake/help/latest/guide/tutorial/index.html). I also used [these docs](https://cliutils.gitlab.io/modern-cmake/README.html) several years ago and they were good for learning the basics.",
